error[E0411]: `str` has no character indexing
 --> mem:///main.lu:4:13
  |
4 |     let c = s[i]
  |             ^^^^ no `s[i]` on `str`
  |
  = note: byte offsets are the honest currency (D25): slice with `s[a..b]` (or the recoverable
    `s.get(a..b)`), read bytes via `s.bytes()`, or use `find` — it returns byte offsets.
